lse,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108339","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108339.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108339.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"There is currently no way to get the name of an image format, which is rather important for helpful warning/error messages in non-game applications and add-ons. `<Enum>.keys()[idx]` just works for user defined enums.\r\n\r\nExample usage:\r\n```GDScript\r\n#...\r\nprint(\"Image format \", Image.get_format_name(img.get_format()), \" not supported, converting to \", Image.get_format_name(Image.FORMAT_RGB8))\r\n# Output: Image format RGBAHalf not supported, converting to RGB8\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108339/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108339/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}